dldb
====

This workspace hosts an installable top-level Python package `dldb` at
`persisting/dldb` (setuptools `package-dir` maps import name `dldb` to that
directory).

Origin: Kun Cai / internal dldb (`feature/timing-model` timing & metrics line).
License: MIT (see `persisting/dldb/LICENSE`), separate from the Apache-2.0
Persisting workspace license.
Install: `pip install -e ./persisting/dldb`
